# Size summary `mac-footprint`: the stored record of one summary, version 1.
# Synthetic: made-up runs fed to the estimator's update path, not farm data.
# Pins: this build encodes the summary to these bytes, decodes them to it, and
# refuses a record with any byte changed.
# A change to this file needs a reason in the pull request that makes it, and the
# file is never rewritten to match a new encoding: see tests/codec_golden.rs.

